WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:01,150
How is it

2
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:02,600
I want to challenge you to a duel

3
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:06,800
I can openly tear this despicable thing like you into pieces.

4
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:08,200
are you ready

5
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:15,540
Have something ready for exciting food?

6
00:00:15,540 --> 00:00:17,740
How could this be just this?

7
00:00:17,740 --> 00:00:22,140
This is what you said about tearing me into pieces openly. Actually

8
00:00:22,140 --> 00:00:23,740
I'm joking

9
00:00:23,740 --> 00:00:28,700
Your joke is killing you

10
00:00:28,700 --> 00:00:33,840
Ninth grade can no longer provide experience

11
00:00:33,840 --> 00:00:34,840
Such a good prey

12
00:00:34,840 --> 00:00:37,040
Just in time to bring Deng Dachan to death

13
00:00:37,040 --> 00:00:44,820
It’s been 14 days, brother, dad, dear dad, have you forgotten me?

14
00:00:44,820 --> 00:00:45,820
The food all stinks

15
00:00:45,820 --> 00:00:50,020
I don’t even have to drink water. I’m going to the ninth level to kiss my father.

16
00:00:50,020 --> 00:00:51,620
Are you now at level nine?

17
00:00:51,620 --> 00:00:52,620
Not the ninth grade

18
00:00:52,620 --> 00:00:56,040
It's exciting

19
00:00:56,040 --> 00:00:58,640
I'll go to Taolin to get some things figured out.

20
00:00:58,640 --> 00:01:02,680
Kill the Lord of the Peach Grove and throw him away

21
00:01:02,680 --> 00:01:15,430
It's exciting

22
00:01:15,430 --> 00:01:17,430
Eaten so many bugs

23
00:01:17,430 --> 00:01:19,430
Nothing happened at all
